OL,3,GNEWSAHackney Turk shot in restaurant
OL,4,Ajailed for attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn east London gang member who was the
OL,7,Fintended target of a shooting - in
OL,8,Fwhich a nine-year-old girl was hit in
OL,9,Fthe head by a stray bullet - has been
OL,10,Fjailed for life for plotting a separate
OL,11,Fgun attack a year later.
OL,13,FBeytullah Gunduz, 40, had been sitting
OL,14,Fin the Evin Restaurant, Dalston,
OL,15,Fminutes before gunmen opened fire
OL,16,Foutside in May 2024, leaving the girl
OL,17,Fwith a serious head wound.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
