OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHackney Turk shot in restaurant
OL,4,Ajailed for attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FGunduz, a senior member of the Hackney
OL,7,FTurks gang, has been found guilty of
OL,8,Fconspiring to murder Onur Guzel, who
OL,9,Fwas shot outside his family's
OL,10,Frestaurant, also in Dalston, in June
OL,11,F2025.
OL,13,FGunduz refused to attend the Old Bailey
OL,14,Fon Friday and was sentenced in his
OL,15,Fabsence to a minimum of 20 years.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
